{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-17-1","title":"Acts 17:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Paul preaches at Thessalonica, where some believe, 5 and others persecute him. 10 He is sent to Berea, and preaches there. 13 Being persecuted by Jews from Thessalonica, 16 he comes to Athens, and disputes and preaches the living God, to them unknown; 32 whereby, though some mock, many are converted unto Christ.</p>\n<p>Thessalonica. 20:4; 27:2; Php 4:16; 1Th 1:1; 2Th 1:1; 2Ti 4:10 where. 14:1; 15:21; 16:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-2","title":"Acts 17:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>as. Lu 4:16; Joh 18:20 went. 10,17; 9:20; 13:5; 14:1; 18:4; 19:8 reasoned. 24:25; 28:23; 1Sa 12:7; Isa 1:18; Heb 7:1-10:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-3","title":"Acts 17:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Opening. 2:16-36; 3:22-26; 13:26-39 Christ. Lu 24:26,27,32,44,46; 1Co 15:3,4; 1Th 1:5,6 this. 2:36; 9:22; 18:28; Ga 3:1 whom I preach. 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-4","title":"Acts 17:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>some. 34; 2:41,42,44; 4:23; 5:12-14; 14:1,4; 28:24; Pr 9:6; 13:20; So 1:7,8 So 6:1; Zec 2:11; 8:20-23; 2Co 6:17,18 consorted. 2Co 8:5 Silas. 15:22,27,32,40 the devout. 17; 13:43; 16:3; 18:4; 19:10; 21:28 and of the chief. 12; 13:50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-5","title":"Acts 17:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>moved. 13; 7:9; 13:45; 14:2,19; 18:12; Pr 14:30; Isa 26:11; Mt 27:18; 1Co 3:3 Ga 5:21,26; Jas 4:5 took. Jud 9:4; Job 30:1-10; Ps 35:15; 69:12 and set. 19:24-34,40 Jason. 7; Ro 16:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-6","title":"Acts 17:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>they drew. 6:12,13; 16:19,20; 18:12,13 These. 21:28-31; 22:22,23; 24:5; 28:22; 1Ki 18:17,18; Ex 3:8,9; Jer 38:2-4 Am 7:10; Lu 23:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-7","title":"Acts 17:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>and these. 16:21; 25:8-11; Ezr 4:12-15; Da 3:12; 6:13; Lu 23:2; Joh 19:12 1Pe 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-8","title":"Acts 17:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Mt 2:3; Joh 11:48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-10","title":"Acts 17:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the brethren. 14; 9:25; 23:23,24; Jos 2:15,16; 1Sa 19:12-17; 20:42 Berea. 13; 20:4 went. 2; 14:6,7; 1Th 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-11","title":"Acts 17:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>more. Pr 1:5; 9:9; Jer 2:21; Joh 1:45-49 they received. 2:41; 10:33; 11:1; Job 23:12; Pr 2:1-5; 8:10; Mt 13:23; 1Th 1:6; 2:13 2Th 2:10; Jas 1:21; 1Pe 2:2 and searched. Ps 1:2,3; 119:97,100,148; Isa 8:20; 34:16; Lu 16:29; 24:44; Joh 3:21 Joh 5:39; 2Ti 3:15-17; 1Pe 1:10-12; 2Pe 1:19-21; 1Jo 4:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-12","title":"Acts 17:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>many. 2-4; 13:46; 14:1; Ps 25:8,9; Joh 1:45-49; 7:17; Eph 5:14; Jas 1:21 honourable. 13:50; 1Co 1:26; Jas 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-13","title":"Acts 17:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the Jews. 5; Mt 23:13; 1Th 2:14-16 stirred. 6:12; 14:2; 21:27; 1Ki 21:25; Pr 15:18; 28:25; Lu 12:51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-14","title":"Acts 17:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>then. 10; 9:25,30; Mt 10:23 as it. 20:3; Jos 2:16 but. 19:22; 1Ti 1:3; Tit 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-15","title":"Acts 17:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Athens. 18:1; 1Th 3:1 receiving. 18:5; 2Ti 4:10,11,20,21; Tit 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-16","title":"Acts 17:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Cir. A.M. 4058. A.D. 54. his spirit. Ex 32:19,20; Nu 25:6-11; 1Ki 19:10,14; Job 32:2,3,18-20; Ps 69:9 Ps 119:136,158; Jer 20:9; Mic 3:8; Mr 3:5; Joh 2:13; 2Pe 2:7 wholly given to idolatry. or, full of idols. 23; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-17","title":"Acts 17:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>disputed. 2-4; 14:1-4 devout. 8:2; 10:2; 13:16 daily. Pr 1:20-22; 8:1-4,34; Jer 6:11; Mt 5:1,2; Mr 16:15; Lu 12:3 2Ti 3:2,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-18","title":"Acts 17:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>philosophers. Ro 1:22; 1Co 1:20,21; Col 2:8 encountered. 6:9; Mr 9:14; Lu 11:53 babbler. or, base fellow. Pr 23:9; 26:12; 1Co 3:18 Jesus. 31; 26:23; Ro 14:9,10; 1Co 15:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-19","title":"Acts 17:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Areopagus. or, Mars'-hill. 22 \"It was the highest court in Athens.\"</p>\n<p>May. 20; 24:24; 25:22; 26:1; Mt 10:18 new. Mr 1:27; Joh 13:34; 1Jo 2:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-20","title":"Acts 17:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>strange. Ho 8:12; Mt 19:23-25; Mr 10:24-26; Joh 6:60; 7:35,36; 1Co 1:18,23 1Co 2:14; Heb 5:11; 1Pe 4:4 what. 2:12; 10:17; Mr 9:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-21","title":"Acts 17:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>spent. Eph 5:16; Col 4:5; 2Th 3:11,12; 1Ti 5:13; 2Ti 2:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-22","title":"Acts 17:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Mars'-hill. or, the court of the Areopagites. 19 I perceive. 16; 19:35; 25:19; Jer 10:2,3; 50:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-23","title":"Acts 17:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>devotions. or, gods that ye worship. Ro 1:23-25; 1Co 8:5; 2Th 2:4 TO. Ps 147:20; Joh 17:3,25; Ro 1:20-22,28; 1Co 1:21; 2Co 4:4-6 Ga 4:8,9; Eph 2:12; 1Ti 1:17; 1Jo 5:20 ignorantly. 30; Ps 50:21; Mt 15:9; Joh 4:22; 8:54</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-24","title":"Acts 17:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>that made. 26-28; 4:24; 14:15; Ps 146:5; Isa 40:12,28; 45:18; Jer 10:11; 32:17 Zec 12:1; Joh 1:1; Heb 1:2; 3:4 seeing. Ge 14:19,22; 2Ki 19:15; Ps 24:1; 115:16; 148:13; Jer 23:24; Da 4:35 Mt 5:34; 11:25; Lu 10:21; Re 20:11 dwelleth. 7:48; 1Ki 8:27; 2Ch 2:6; 6:18; Isa 66:1; Joh 4:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-25","title":"Acts 17:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>is. Job 22:2; 35:6,7; Ps 16:2; 50:8-13; Jer 7:20-23; Am 5:21-23; Mt 9:13 seeing. 28; 14:17; Ge 2:7; Nu 16:22; 27:16; Job 12:10; 27:3; 33:4; 34:14 Ps 104:27-30; Isa 42:5; 57:16; Zec 12:1; Mt 5:45; Ro 11:35; 1Ti 6:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-26","title":"Acts 17:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>hath made. Ge 3:20; 9:19; Mal 2:10; Ro 5:12-19; 1Co 15:22,47 hath determined. 15:18; De 32:7,8; Job 14:5; Ps 31:15; Isa 14:31; 45:21; Da 11:27,35 Heb 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-27","title":"Acts 17:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>they. 15:17; Ps 19:1-6; Ro 1:20; 2:4 he be. 14:17; 1Ki 8:27; Ps 139:1-13; Jer 23:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-28","title":"Acts 17:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>in him. 1Sa 25:29; Job 12:10; Ps 36:9; 66:9; Lu 20:38; Joh 5:26; 11:25 Col 1:17; Heb 1:3 as. Tit 1:12 we are. Lu 3:38; Heb 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-29","title":"Acts 17:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>we ought. Ps 94:7-9; 106:20; 115:4-8; Isa 40:12-18; 44:9-20; Hab 2:19,20 Ro 1:20-23 graven. Ex 20:4; 32:4; Isa 46:5,6; Jer 10:4-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-30","title":"Acts 17:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>the times. 14:16; Ps 50:21; Ro 1:28; 3:23,25 but. 3:19; 11:18; 20:21; 26:17-20; Mt 3:2; 4:17; Mr 6:12; Lu 13:5; 15:10 Lu 24:47; Ro 2:4; 2Co 7:10; Eph 4:17-32; 5:6-8; Tit 2:11,12 1Pe 1:14,15; 4:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-31","title":"Acts 17:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>he hath appointed. 10:42; Mt 25:31-46; Joh 5:22,23; Ro 2:5,16; 14:9,10; 1Co 4:5 2Co 5:10; 2Ti 4:1; 2Pe 3:7; Jude 1:14,15 given assurance. or, offered faith. in that. 18; 2:23,24,32; 3:15,16; 4:10; 5:30-32; 10:39-41; 13:30,31 Lu 24:46-48; 1Co 15:3-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-32","title":"Acts 17:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>some. 18; 2:13; 13:41; 25:19; 26:8,24,25; Ge 19:14; 2Ch 30:9-11; 36:16 Lu 22:63; 23:11,36; 1Co 1:23; 4:10; Heb 11:36; 13:13 We will. 24:25; Lu 14:18; 2Co 6:2; Heb 3:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-17-34","title":"Acts 17:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>certain. 4; 13:48; Isa 55:10-11; Mt 20:16; Ro 11:5,6 the Areopagite. 19; Joh 7:48-52; 19:38-42; Php 4:22</p>"}]}